<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1157] Ignite startup in client mode silently hanging</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1157</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See this thread on dev list &lt;tt&gt;Ignite startup in client mode silently hanging&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;need to overload &lt;tt&gt;LT.warn()&lt;/tt&gt; - Add &lt;tt&gt;boolean quiet&lt;/tt&gt; parameter to &lt;tt&gt;LogThrottle.warn()&lt;/tt&gt;. If &lt;tt&gt;true&lt;/tt&gt; then use &lt;tt&gt;U.quietAndWarn()&lt;/tt&gt; instead of &lt;tt&gt;U.warn()&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;set this parameter to &lt;tt&gt;true&lt;/tt&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;org/apache/ignite/spi/discovery/tcp/ClientImpl.java:437&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;and org/apache/ignite/spi/discovery/tcp/ServerImpl.java:834&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
